<https://w3id.org/def/norma-o#Facultative> rdf:type owl:Class .


###  https://w3id.org/def/norma-o#LegalAction
<https://w3id.org/def/norma-o#LegalAction> rdf:type owl:Class .


###  https://w3id.org/def/norma-o#LegalAgent
<https://w3id.org/def/norma-o#LegalAgent> rdf:type owl:Class .


###  https://w3id.org/def/norma-o#LegalCondition
<https://w3id.org/def/norma-o#LegalCondition> rdf:type owl:Class .


###  https://w3id.org/def/norma-o#NegativeRecommendation
<https://w3id.org/def/norma-o#NegativeRecommendation> rdf:type owl:Class .


